{"id":"a608834464a94923","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-moser-trudinger.md","title":"Moser–Trudinger Inequality","display":"df-moser-trudinger — Moser–Trudinger Inequality","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-moser-trudinger","aliases":["58-df-moser-trudinger"],"display":"df-moser-trudinger — Moser–Trudinger Inequality","depends_on":["[[58-df-sobolev-space]]","[[58-df-measure-space]]","[[58-df-exponential]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-moser-trudinger"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-moser-trudinger</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-moser-trudinger — Moser–Trudinger Inequality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c58fda0da62833\" href=\"?note=38c58fda0da62833\" title=\"58-df-sobolev-space\">58-df-sobolev-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"689fa138a0ce2d6c\" href=\"?note=689fa138a0ce2d6c\" title=\"58-df-exponential\">58-df-exponential</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,\\mathcal F,\\mu\\in V\">\\(W,\\mathcal F,\\mu\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,\\Omega,n,1,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,\\Omega,n,1,n)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"38c58fda0da62833\" href=\"?note=38c58fda0da62833\" title=\"58-df-sobolev-space\">58-df-sobolev-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MT}_S(\\Omega,W,\\mathcal F,\\mu,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{MT}_S(\\Omega,W,\\mathcal F,\\mu,n)\\)</span> (property defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}moser\\text{-}trudinger}\\vdash\\operatorname{MT}_S(\\Omega,W,\\mathcal F,\\mu,n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,\\Omega,n,1,n)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land0&lt;\\mu(\\Omega)&lt;\\infty\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall u\\in W\\;\\left(\\int_\\Omega u\\,d\\mu=0\\land\\lVert\\nabla u\\rVert_{L^n(\\Omega,\\mu)}\\leq1\\to\\int_\\Omega\\exp\\!\\left(n\\,\\lvert\\mathbb S^{n-1}\\rvert^{1/(n-1)}\\lvert u(x)\\rvert^{n/(n-1)}\\right)\\,d\\mu\\leq C\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}moser\\text{-}trudinger}\\vdash\\operatorname{MT}_S(\\Omega,W,\\mathcal F,\\mu,n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,\\Omega,n,1,n)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land0&lt;\\mu(\\Omega)&lt;\\infty\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall u\\in W\\;\\left(\\int_\\Omega u\\,d\\mu=0\\land\\lVert\\nabla u\\rVert_{L^n(\\Omega,\\mu)}\\leq1\\to\\int_\\Omega\\exp\\!\\left(n\\,\\lvert\\mathbb S^{n-1}\\rvert^{1/(n-1)}\\lvert u(x)\\rvert^{n/(n-1)}\\right)\\,d\\mu\\leq C\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Trudinger (1971): <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_0^{1,n} \\hookrightarrow L^q\">\\(W_0^{1,n} \\hookrightarrow L^q\\)</span> for all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q &lt; \\infty\">\\(q &lt; \\infty\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Moser (1971): sharp exponential bound.</li>\n<li>Criticality: fails for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha &gt; \\alpha_n\">\\(\\alpha &gt; \\alpha_n\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The finite-measure and zero-mean guards remove the constant-function obstruction to a gradient-only bound.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-sobolev-space","status":"resolved","id":"38c58fda0da62833","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sobolev-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-exponential","status":"resolved","id":"689fa138a0ce2d6c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-exponential]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sobolev-space","status":"resolved","id":"38c58fda0da62833","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,\\Omega,n,1,n)$ (see [[58-df-sobolev-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)$ (see [[58-df-measure-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"W,\\mathcal F,\\mu\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,\\Omega,n,1,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MT}_S(\\Omega,W,\\mathcal F,\\mu,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}moser\\text{-}trudinger}\\vdash\\operatorname{MT}_S(\\Omega,W,\\mathcal F,\\mu,n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SobolevSpace}_S(W,\\Omega,n,1,n)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land0<\\mu(\\Omega)<\\infty\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall u\\in W\\;\\left(\\int_\\Omega u\\,d\\mu=0\\land\\lVert\\nabla u\\rVert_{L^n(\\Omega,\\mu)}\\leq1\\to\\int_\\Omega\\exp\\!\\left(n\\,\\lvert\\mathbb S^{n-1}\\rvert^{1/(n-1)}\\lvert u(x)\\rvert^{n/(n-1)}\\right)\\,d\\mu\\leq C\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"W_0^{1,n} \\hookrightarrow L^q","display":false},{"tex":"q < \\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha > \\alpha_n","display":false}],"bytes":1450,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-863","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-moser-trudinger.md|58-df-moser-trudinger]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["38c58fda0da62833","83a15c7e9b3817dc","689fa138a0ce2d6c"]}